        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Kir-yath-ya-rim thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben ka̱n, kä cua jɛ nööŋ dhɔr Ä-bi-na-dab rɛy päämni. Kä cua gatdɛ ni Ɛl-a-dhar ben lɛy, kɛ ɣöö bɛ thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth Nhial tit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu thanduk matdä ruac Kuɔth Nhial te kä Kir-yath-ya-rim kɛ pëk mi bäär, cuɛ tekɛ run ti jiɛɛn da̱ŋ rɛw. Kɛn pëk ɛ mɔ cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal wiee nhiam Kuɔth Nhial görkɛ luäk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruec Tha-muɛl kɛ I-thɛ-rɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Tha-muɛl ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal jiök i̱, “Mi rietdɛ rɔ̱ Kuoth Nhial kɛ lɔcdun kɛɛliw kua pua̱ny kuthni Ac-ta-roth kɛnɛ kuth tin kɔ̱ŋ woc rɛydun, kä ka̱mɛ lo̱ckun ni Kuoth Nhial, kä palɛ ni jɛ kä rɔa, bɛ yɛ kän tetni ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kuoth Baal kɛnɛ Ac-ta-roth päl, cua pal ni Kuoth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl wee i̱, “Matdɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kä Midh-pa, kɛ ɣöö bä Kuoth Nhial wä pal kɛ kui̱dun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ rɔ dol kä Midh-pa, cua pi̱ jɔm kä cua kɛ muɔc piny ala muc nhiam Kuɔth Nhial. Kä cukɛ thɛɛk ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ. Kä cukɛ wee “Ca̱kɔ Kuoth Nhial duer duer.” Cu Tha-muɛl ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl böth kä Midh-pa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "täämɛ mëë ci ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ɛ liŋ i̱ ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ̱ dol kä Midh-pa, cu kua̱r Pi-li-thɛt ben, ma̱kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä mëë ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ liŋ, cukɛ dual kɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ Tha-muɛl jiök i̱, “Pal Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdan kɛ kui̱dan kɛ ɣöö bɛ kɔn kän kä ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Tha-muɛl ruath dɛ̈ɛ̈l mi luëth Ka̱n kä cuɛ jɛ thöp Kuoth Nhial ala muc mi waŋkɛ kɛɛliw. Kä cuɛ Kuoth Nhial pal kɛ kui̱ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɛ loc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë thöp Tha-muɛl muc in waŋkɛ. Cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ben thie̱kä, ma̱kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Ɛn cäŋ ɛ mɔ cu Kuoth Nhial ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt mär kɛ ma̱r mi di̱i̱t mi cu wuɔ̱thkiɛn nyon. Kä cukɛ rɔ bar nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl käny raar kä Midh-pa guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt, cukɛ kɛ näk aräth ni kä Beth-kar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Tha-muɛl päm ka̱n kä cuɛ jɛ la̱th kam Midh-pa kɛnɛ Ɣä-cen, kä cuɛ ciötdɛ cɔli päm luäkä. Kɛ ɣöö laarɛ jɛ i̱, “Kuoth Nhial luäkɛ kɔn duɔ̱pni diaal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt cu kɔ̱a̱c, /ka̱n rɔ nyɔk kɛ wä wi̱i̱ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt duäc kɛ nin teekä Tha-muɛl diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua wi̱i̱ tëë ci ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt kɛ ka̱n kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl Luɔc I-thɛ-rɛl, a känɛ ni kä Ɛk-ron a wä ni kä Gɛ̈th. Cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl wi̱i̱kiɛn ka̱n kä Ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt kä cuɛ tekɛ mal kam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ ji̱ Ɛ-mor bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Tha-muɛl I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ ni̱n teekädɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä run kä run la wee ja̱l kä Beth-ɛl kɛ Gil-gal kɛnɛ Midh-pa, cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac ɛn gua̱thni tɔ̱tɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä la bëë kä Rama, kɛ ɣöö te dhɔrɛ thi̱n, kä cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac ɛn wi̱ni. Kä cuɛ Kuoth Nhial ta̱th yi̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
